---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTA from '../components/sections/CTA.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="A Hanoi-born, globally operating team built around specialist execution and AI-powered workflows.">
  <section class="about-hero section surface-dark"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Who we are</p><h1>Global campaign operators.<br /><span>Specialist execution.</span><br />Accelerated by AI.</h1></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container story"><p class="eyebrow">Since 2015</p><div><h2>Built around what your growth needs.</h2><p>AM Digital is an AI-powered GTM operations agency founded in Hanoi. For more than a decade, we have run campaigns across global and local markets—from DTC ecommerce to technology and app products.</p><p>We work from strategy through execution, with automation wired into every workflow so campaigns move faster, reporting stays continuous and the operation remains efficient at every scale.</p><img src="/images/am-market-entry.webp" width="1400" height="1050" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="A Vietnamese strategist leading an international market-entry workshop in Hanoi" /></div></div></section>
  <section class="section surface-green"><div class="container principles"><article><span>01</span><h3>Global campaign reach</h3><p>Run campaigns across the US, Vietnam, India, LATAM and Europe without waiting for a single-market test to finish.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Specialist operational depth</h3><p>Paid growth, creator operations, organic visibility and GTM strategy operate as one connected motion.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>AI at every layer</h3><p>Automation supports sourcing, reporting, scheduling and outreach so human judgment stays focused where it matters.</p></article></div></section>
  <CTA />
</BaseLayout>
<style>.about-hero h1{margin-top:1rem;max-width:13ch}.about-hero span{color:var(--green)}.story{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 3fr;gap:3rem}.story h2{margin-bottom:2rem}.story p{max-width:52rem;margin-block:1rem;color:#35423d}.story img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;margin-top:3rem;border-radius:var(--radius)}.principles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem}.principles article{padding:2rem;border:1px solid var(--ink);border-radius:var(--radius)}.principles span{font-weight:900}.principles h3{margin:3rem 0 1rem}@media(max-width:760px){.story,.principles{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
